    "description": "Sometimes a smuggler has to fight his way out of a bad situation. If you fail any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check to convey deceptive information, you can initiate combat and make a single <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> attack as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a> in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprise_Round\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprise Round\">Surprise Round</a> (or with a melee or ranged weapon, if you have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Quick_Draw\" title=\"Quick Draw\">Quick Draw</a> feat); all other combatants are considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">Surprised</a> even if they are aware of you.",
